            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coreflective+subcategory"} coreflection
            along this inclusion. The following proposition establishes that this coreflection indeed exists.
          #EtaleSlice.num_defn
            %h6#definition_2 Definition
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
