                      %mi fet
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (\mathbf{H}_{th})_{/X}^{fet}
              is full, it is sufficient to show that the
              = succeed "-colimit" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
